      "widgets_values": [
        "A woman with voluminous, cascading platinum-blonde waves framing her face, her skin pale and flawless, wears an elaborate black lace high-collared dress adorned with pearl buttons and intricate gold embroidery, her hands encased in sheer black lace gloves. She holds a delicate teacup filled with deep crimson liquid, her red eyes glowing with a soft, ethereal light as she gazes directly at the viewer with a serene, almost melancholic expression, her posture relaxed yet regal. The foreground is dominated by the intricate details of her gloved hands and the gleaming porcelain of the cup, while the midground reveals the lush texture of her ruffled sleeves and the way light catches the fine threads of her gown. The background is a dreamlike garden of towering white roses and deep red blooms, with a shimmering, crystal-like chandelier structure rising behind her head, partially obscured by the soft bokeh of falling light and fluttering pink butterflies. The composition follows a low-angle heroic shot, placing her slightly off-center to create dynamic tension, with her gaze and the rim of the teacup creating a strong leading line that draws the eye upward. The camera is a 105mm lens at F1.8, with the focal plane razor-sharp on her red eyes, allowing the background and her hair to melt into a creamy, natural blur that separates her from the garden. A warm, golden-hour sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled shadows across her face and highlighting the sheen of her hair, while the overall color tone is a romantic blend of black and white with accents of crimson and rose gold, creating a mood of elegant, timeless mystery.,"
      ],
